      "content": "that makes sense. so the lecithin is basically losing its ability to hold the interface together because of the charge change. if we wanted to stabilize it without adding more egg yolk, what kind of alternative emulsifiers or stabilizers would you suggest that can handle that kind of acidity? maybe something like xanthan gum or a different phospholipid?",
